Full text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

The recording was made with the informed consent of the participant, who
reviewed the material. Users of neighbouring plots who could enter the
sensor field were informed in advance and consented. No faces are present
in the released data, which consists of 3D point coordinates and derived
numerical arrays only.
